Shopkeeper: Anyway, I'll let you finish up those items. 
Shopkeeper: Pretty small batch today, and it's the best way to learn, if you ask me. 
Shopkeeper: I've got some errands to run, so I'll leave you to it. 
Shopkeeper: Think you're up to it?
- Sure am. 
